From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 23:08:22 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] msvcp: Export the ids of the money facets and of
 time_get<unsigned short>.

The money facets are not implemented here, but a program built against the headers compiles them in
itself and imports only their ids: mso30win32client.dll takes those of moneypunct<wchar_t> and
money_put<wchar_t> from msvcp140.  Without the exports the loader points them at a stub, and
use_facet() takes the stub's code bytes as the facet's index.  The intl constants of moneypunct go
with them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

